Version 0.0.3.667.8 - Major UI/UX Overhaul & Feature Expansion

==== RELEASE NOTES ====

This release marks a significant step toward production-ready quality, featuring a completely redesigned UI/UX system, expanded applications, improved animations, and critical bug fixes. The Workstation CLI integration is now fully operational.

---

==== INSTALLATION & SETUP ====

**Install.sh Enhancement:**
  The install.sh script has been updated to:
  
  1. Create a dedicated ~/CLI subdirectory (non-destructive — does not replace existing files)
  2. Clone the Workstation CLI repository into ~/CLI:
     git clone https://github.com/WorkableProjects/WorkstationCLI.git ~/CLI
  3. Initialize CLI configuration and set up shell aliases for system-wide access
  4. Run post-install validation to ensure all components are properly linked
  5. Generate a setup summary with next steps and quick-start commands
  
  Installation command:
    bash install.sh
    
  Post-installation, start the Workstation Studio:
    npm start
    
  Verify CLI integration:
    workstation --version

**README.md Updates:**
  - Corrected installation instructions with step-by-step setup guide
  - Updated start.sh to source CLI environment variables
  - Added troubleshooting section for common setup issues
  - Included system requirements and dependency checks
  - Added links to CLI repository and documentation

