==== CORE APPLICATION IMPROVEMENTS ====

**1. UI/UX System Redesign**
  
  - **Start Menu Overhaul:**
    * Removed AI-generated center-aligned aesthetic
    * Aligned menu to left (Windows-style clarity)
    * Removed decorative icons; replaced with clear, unique text labels
    * Improved visual hierarchy with font weights and spacing
    * Added keyboard navigation (Arrow keys, Enter to select)
    * Hover states and active application indicators
    * Search/filter functionality to quickly access apps
    * Recent apps section for quick access
    
  - **Taskbar Redesign:**
    * Cleaner, more compact design matching OS conventions
    * System tray with clock, volume, network status
    * Notification badges on app icons
    * Right-click context menus on taskbar items (minimize, maximize, close, pin)
    
  - **Window Management:**
    * Unified minimize/maximize/close button styling
    * Window snap-to-grid for alignment
    * Window shadow and depth styling for better hierarchy
    * Restored windows remembers previous size and position
    * Maximize button respects available screen space

**2. Animation System (Comprehensive)**
  
  - **Window Animations:**
    * Smooth fade-in on app launch (250ms)
    * Bounce-out effect on minimize (300ms)
    * Slide-up animation on maximize/restore (250ms)
    * Smooth fade-out on close (200ms)
    * Window resize animations with spring easing
    
  - **Menu Animations:**
    * Slide-in from left for start menu (300ms)
    * Fade/slide transitions between menu sections
    * Icon animations on hover (scale 1.05, shadow increase)
    * Submenu cascading animations (stagger 30ms between items)
    
  - **App Transitions:**
    * Cross-fade between different app views (150ms)
    * Scale + fade for modal dialogs (200ms)
    * Slide transitions for drawer/sidebar reveal (250ms)
    
  - **System Events:**
    * Notification toast animations (slide-in bottom, slide-out top)
    * Loading spinner with smooth continuous rotation
    * Focus ring animations on keyboard navigation (pulse effect)
    * Validation feedback animations (shake for errors, checkmark for success)

