==== APPLICATION FEATURES (EXPANDED) ====

**1. File Manager (FULLY FUNCTIONAL)**
  
  Built as a complete file browser matching Windows Explorer and macOS Finder:
  
  Features:
    * Two-pane view (folder tree on left, file list on right)
    * File/folder icons with thumbnail previews for images
    * Sort by name, date modified, size, type
    * Filter by file type (.txt, .pdf, .md, etc.)
    * Search with regex support across current directory
    * Multi-select with Ctrl+Click or Shift+Click
    * Copy/paste/cut/delete operations with undo stack
    * Rename files and folders (in-place editing)
    * Create new file/folder dialogs
    * Drag-and-drop file operations
    * Breadcrumb navigation showing full path
    * Quick access sidebar (Home, Desktop, Documents, Downloads)
    * Directory tree with expand/collapse
    * Properties panel showing file details (size, type, modified date, permissions)
    * File preview pane for text files and images
    * Favorites/bookmarks for frequently accessed folders
    * Recent files list
    * Full keyboard navigation (Tab, Arrow keys, Enter, Delete)
    * Right-click context menus on files and folders
    * Batch operations (rename, move, copy multiple files)
    * Desktop integration (drag files to desktop shortcut)

**2. Notes Application (MARKDOWN-ENABLED)**
  
  Full-featured note-taking with rich formatting:
  
  Features:
    * WYSIWYG Markdown editor with live preview (split-pane view)
    * Markdown toolbar with formatting shortcuts (bold, italic, headers, lists, code)
    * Syntax highlighting for inline code and code blocks
    * Support for: headers, bold, italic, strikethrough, quotes, lists, links, images
    * Auto-save to project-local folder (/notes) every 30 seconds
    * Browser localStorage backup for offline access
    * Folder structure within /notes for organizing by topic/date
    * Rename and delete notes with confirmation
    * Search notes by title and content
    * Tags system for categorizing notes
    * Export notes as .md, .pdf, or .html
    * Create new note dialog with title and optional tags
    * Pinned notes section at top
    * Last-modified timestamp for each note
    * Rich formatting preview (rendered HTML)
    * Copy/paste support with format preservation
    * Undo/redo for note edits (50-action history)
    * Fullscreen focus mode for distraction-free writing

**3. Tasks & To-Do List (TIME-BASED WITH NOTIFICATIONS)**
  
  Time-aware task management with native notifications:
  
  Features:
    * Add tasks with title, description, due date, and time
    * Task priority levels (Low, Medium, High, Urgent)
    * Repeat options (daily, weekly, monthly, custom)
    * Set completion by time — system notifies when time arrives
    * Sub-tasks/checklist items within tasks
    * Categories/projects for organizing tasks
    * Calendar view showing tasks by date
    * Agenda view for today and upcoming days
    * Drag-and-drop to reorganize tasks and change due dates
    * Mark complete with visual strikethrough
    * Undo for completed tasks (within 30 seconds)
    * Search and filter tasks by status, priority, category
    * Today/This Week/This Month quick filters
    * Show overdue tasks with red indicator
    * Recurring task management (edit series or single instance)
    * Time-based notifications (desktop notification + in-app alert)
    * Notification settings per task (15 min before, on time, custom)
    * Notification badge showing count of due tasks
    * Bulk operations (mark multiple as complete, delete, change priority)
    
  **Notifications Component (Matches Theme):**
    * Toast notifications appearing bottom-right with slide-in animation
    * Icon, title, and message for each notification
    * Auto-dismiss after 5 seconds (customizable)
    * Click to open related task
    * Manual dismiss button (X)
    * Sound alert option (configurable)
    * Notification history accessible from notification center (top-right)
    * Notification count badge on taskbar
    * Theme-aware styling matching app's dark/light mode
    * Progress indicator for long-running operations

**4. Calculator (SCIENTIFIC + DESMOS INTEGRATION)**
  
  Enhanced calculator with scientific functions and graphing:
  
  Basic Features:
    * Standard operations (+, −, ×, ÷, %)
    * Decimal support with proper precision
    * Clear (AC) and delete (backspace) functions
    * Parentheses for complex expressions
    * History of recent calculations (scrollable)
    
  Scientific Mode:
    * Trigonometric functions (sin, cos, tan, arcsin, arccos, arctan)
    * Hyperbolic functions (sinh, cosh, tanh)
    * Logarithmic functions (log, ln, log₂)
    * Powers and roots (x², x³, √x, ∛x, xʸ)
    * Constants (π, e, φ)
    * Factorial (n!)
    * Degrees/Radians toggle
    * Memory operations (M+, M−, MR, MC)
    
  **Desmos Integration:**
    * Embedded Desmos graphing calculator for complex visualizations
    * Plot functions and equations
    * Support for parametric and polar equations
    * Interactive graph manipulation (pan, zoom)
    * Adjustable point visibility and axis labels
    * Export graphs as images
    * LaTeX input support for advanced equations
    * Multiple function plotting with color differentiation
    * Solution finder for equations

