==== BUG FIXES & STABILITY ====

**Critical Fixes:**
  • Fixed window state management causing crashes on rapid window operations
  • Resolved memory leak in event listeners (proper cleanup on app close)
  • Fixed localStorage quota exceeded errors by implementing size checks
  • Corrected z-index conflicts preventing proper modal stacking
  • Fixed keyboard focus trapping in modals
  • Resolved CSS transitions interfering with layout (will-change optimization)
  • Fixed touch event handling on mobile/tablet devices
  • Corrected animation frame dropouts on older devices (frame rate detection)
  
**UI/UX Fixes:**
  • Start menu now properly closes on outside click
  • Taskbar no longer hides window content
  • Window dragging now respects screen boundaries
  • Fixed scrollbar appearance in different browsers
  • Corrected text selection behavior in title bars
  • Fixed right-click context menu positioning
  • Resolved double-click issues on buttons and windows
  
**Application-Specific Fixes:**
  • File Manager: Fixed folder navigation history
  • Notes: Fixed sync conflicts between browser storage and local files
  • Tasks: Fixed timezone issues with time-based notifications
  • Calculator: Fixed floating-point precision errors in chain operations

