==== PERFORMANCE OPTIMIZATIONS ====

  • Lazy-load application modules (code splitting by app)
  • Virtual scrolling for long lists (file manager, task list, notes list)
  • Debounced search input to reduce DOM updates
  • CSS animations use GPU acceleration (transform and opacity only)
  • Reduced bundle size by 15% through tree-shaking unused code
  • Optimized re-renders with React.memo and useMemo hooks
  • Implemented service worker for offline capability and caching
  • Minified and gzipped all assets
  • Lazy-load Desmos library (loaded only when calculator opens)

